OL,3,GNEWSA'If it wasn't for my parents I
OL,4,Awouldn't be a footballer'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was always my dream. All I can
OL,7,Fremember from when I was little is
OL,8,Fbeing in the garden with my dad and
OL,9,Fbrothers kicking a ball," said Beth
OL,10,FRoberts.
OL,12,FAfter helping Wolves Women secure
OL,13,Fpromotion to Women's Super League 2,
OL,14,FRoberts, a 25-year-old university
OL,15,Fstudent from Staffordshire, has
OL,16,Ffulfilled her dream of becoming a
OL,17,Fprofessional footballer with the club.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
