OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'If it wasn't for my parents I
OL,4,Awouldn't be a footballer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said her love of the game was
OL,7,Ffostered by her father, Tony. She
OL,8,Fstarted playing football with her
OL,9,Ffamily, before joining Bradwell Belles
OL,10,Faged nine, later progressing through
OL,11,FStoke City's academy and joining
OL,12,FWolves.
OL,14,F"I'm proud of myself but I'm also proud
OL,15,Fof my family because I wouldn't be
OL,16,Fwhere I am without them," she said.
